ages his or her mind and intellect with the Eternal Being, easily enjoys the infinite bliss of contact with God. Because of perceiving the omnipresent Eternal Being abiding in all beings, and all beings abiding in the Eternal Being; a yogi, who is in union with the Eternal Being, sees every being with an equal eye. Those who perceive Me in everything and behold everything in Me, are not separated from Me, and I am not separated from them. The nondualists, who adore Me as abiding in all beings, abide in Me irrespective of their mode of living. One is considered the best yogi who regards every being like oneself and who can feel the pain and pleasures of others as one’s own, O Arjuna.","start":273.912,"dur":51.84,"words":[[0.125,0.512,"Supreme"],[0.65,0.35,"bliss"],[1.012,0.3,"comes"],[1.325,0.138,"to"],[1.475,0.062,"a"],[1.55,0.787,"Self-realized"],[2.35,0.45,"yogi"],[3.075,0.163,"whose"],[3.25,0.312,"mind"],[3.575,0.1,"is"],[3.688,0.562,"tranquil"],[4.525,0.138,"whose"],[4.675,0.537,"desires"],[5.225,0.05,"are"],[5.287,0.25,"under"],[5.55,0.55,"control"],[6.388,0.075,"and"],[6.475,0.138,"who"],[6.625,0.138,"is"],[6.775,0.225,"free"],[7.013,0.225,"from"],[7.25,0.425,"sin"],[7.85,0.1,"or"],[7.963,0.613,"faults"],[8.938,0.375,"Such"],[9.325,0.075,"a"],[9.412,0.438,"sinless"],[9.863,0.438,"yogi"],[10.55,0.1,"who"],[10.662,0.588,"constantly"],[11.262,0.537,"engages"],[11.812,0.287,"his"],[12.113,0.087,"or"],[12.213,0.163,"her"],[12.387,0.388,"mind"],[12.787,0.113,"and"],[12.912,0.537,"intellect"],[13.463,0.113,"with"],[13.588,0.087,"the"],[13.688,0.45,"Eternal"],[14.15,0.388,"Being"],[14.9,0.338,"easily"],[15.25,0.475,"enjoys"],[15.738,0.1,"the"],[15.85,0.5,"infinite"],[16.363,0.287,"bliss"],[16.663,0.113,"of"],[16.788,0.525,"contact"],[17.325,0.125,"with"],[17.462,0.412,"God"],[18.238,0.35,"Because"],[18.6,0.1,"of"],[18.712,0.537,"perceiving"],[19.262,0.113,"the"],[19.387,0.637,"omnipresent"],[20.038,0.475,"Eternal"],[20.525,0.212,"Being"],[20.75,0.5,"abiding"],[21.262,